  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "The <b>Max Speed</b> property controls how fast the player moves forward.\n\nGo deeper:\n\n\u2022 When you select a GameObject in the Hierarchy, you\u2019ll see its <b>components</b> in the <b>Inspector.</b>\n\n\u2022 Components contain <b>properties</b> that give a GameObject specific functionalities.\n\n\u2022 The <b>Player Controller</b> component contains the properties that make the player move in response to player input."
